bleed.

50
00:05:02,520 --> 00:05:08,000
You weren't saved by chance.

51
00:05:05,640 --> 00:05:10,440
You were saved because someone stood his

52
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:14,200
ground and refused to believe the

53
00:05:10,440 --> 00:05:14,200
Mordains were untouchable.

54
00:05:17,880 --> 00:05:22,560
They call him an outlaw because they are

55
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:24,360
