59
00:05:30,440 --> 00:05:35,640
You've seen it.

60
00:05:32,320 --> 00:05:38,640
Cherish your freedom.

61
00:05:35,640 --> 00:05:41,520
And do not let fear back into your

62
00:05:38,640 --> 00:05:41,520
